    'why the <b>balance point</b> (the L1 point) sits about 85% of the way to the Moon instead of at the midpoint',
    'what <b>xGEO</b> (cislunar space) means, and where its inner and outer boundaries lie',
    'how to switch between the <b>four reference frames</b> — and why the right frame turns a confusing tangle of motion into a simple, steady picture',
    'why reaching the Moon means <b>leading it like a duck hunter</b>',
